Z||000000||JSocha||08-16-2001||11:31 AM||||<B><u><FONT SIZE="3">Current Zodiac Status:</FONT></u></B><P>10 - Aries<BR>10 – Taurus<BR><B>15 – Gemini</B><BR>10 – Cancer<BR>03 – Leo<BR>06 - Virgo<BR>02 – Libra<BR>08 - Scorpio<BR>05 - Sagittarius<BR>14 - Capricorn = (17 if you include 3 non members)<BR>09 – Aquarius<BR>06 - Pisces<P>EDIT:  Tallys updated on 8-22-01 at 09:01 AM Forum Time<BR>===========================================<BR>RossT and I over beers this past weekend came across something that we thought was odd.<P>A friend of mine who lives in Florida now and is still in contact with my other good friend who was also out for drinks, had bought and still owns his Fiero.  He is a Capricorn, born on the same day as I only one year earlier.  (Working on getting him to join PFF...Steve O. of Rugby, if you've joined, please say hi!               <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )<P>Well anyways, I'm a Capricorn and I love Fieros.<P>RossT admitted               <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> this weekend he was a Capricorn when we were talking about it.<P>I just found out from my business partner (a 52 year old) this morning, who several years back owned two ground up restored Fieros, loves them like there is no tomorrow as well and he is also a Capricorn.<P>And my next door neighbor's son, who was again born on the same day as I, only in 1975/76, as I talked to his father while scheduling service and a good cleaning this morning wants me to keep an eye out for a good used 86-88 Fiero GT, low miles for him as his son is in love with the car as well and is looking, but does not have a computer.<P>So, is there a corelation to ones Zodiac sign and that of individuals owning or liking Fieros?  You do not have to own one to be part of this POLL.<P>That now makes 5 Capricorns who love Fiero's.<P>I'm just curious now which Zodiac sign is the most prevelent here to those that own Fiero's.  Lets see and get the word in the other threads to shoot over here for a moment.  I didn't want to get several threads for the same thing going.<P>------------------<BR>                <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by JSocha (edited 08-22-2001).]||||reg||5
